Perfect — here’s Option 3 fully implemented: an upgraded exporter that explicitly captures JCA (adapter) connection instances (JNDIs) per adapter, and a matching importer that creates any missing JCA connection instances in your local adapter deployment plans (and redeploys the adapters so the JNDIs show up under Outbound Connection Pools).

Both are WLST/Jython-safe (no ternaries, no with open, no time), with clear logs and a final summary.

